## Example
```text
project-root/
  cmd/
  internal/
  pkg/
  api/
  configs/
  scripts/
  build/
  deployments/
  test/
  docs/
  tools/
  examples/
  third_party/
  githooks/
  assets/
  website/
  README.md
  go.mod
  go.sum
```

This rule should be referenced for all new Go code and when reviewing project structure or code quality.
